cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  pyghe drives the simulation kernel of GHE Analysis from Python; it is not
  separate software. If it helped your work, please cite GHE Analysis with its
  concept DOI, given below as the preferred citation.
title: pyghe
abstract: >-
  Python interface to the simulation kernel of GHE Analysis: borehole thermal
  resistance, g-functions, hourly entering fluid temperatures and the sizing of
  ground heat exchangers.
type: software
authors:
